      "product": "FM-1_102",
      "sha256": "7b169a69b30570581d0ebc7b44851e3e08898d2956ade155363bcf18fac5c348",
      "version": "FM-1_102",
      "what": "Keeps M-VAVE's FM engine and effects, fixes its engine bugs, and adds a Virtual Analog engine, an 8-Bit engine, a Bitcrush effect, a 64-step sequencer, and a Note Engine for arpeggios, auto-arpeggios, and auto-chords. It installs from Baud Girl's own browser page, keeps your presets, and can put M-VAVE's firmware back. This editor reads and writes its FM, Virtual Analog, and 8-Bit presets, effects included, keeps the 8-Bit ones in the library, and downloads them as presets files."
